      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "What do you mean by \"selective\". Select who can press it? or make it delete only the drawing of the people who select the button?\n\nLocking to a host can prove frustrating if the room is filled, but the host is afk or something.\n\nVoting can also be bad, unless you give a timer like 20 seconds, and after that, all the people that didn't vote automatically agree. With a cooldown so you cannot spam it too.\n\nOther options can be to make multiple rooms, or locationns within this room with their ownn button for that section. \nSomeone can claim a section and thereby be able to erase in that section.\nWhen they leave the room you have like a few minutes before your claim will be removed.\nWhen they leave the room, their drawing will be erased automatically so that there's no need to erase the trash that some people make.\n\nThese sound like solutions to me.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
